== Usage ==
=== Private Island ===
'''Redstone Lamps''' can be placed as a block on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} or plots in {{Zone|The Garden}}. When activated from a [[Redstone]] signal, it will turn on, but there are [[Private Island#Redstone Restrictions|restrictions]] on how often this can be done. Redstone is disabled on {{Zone|The Garden}}.

